        "text": "Visit Laane-Viru County: 2026 Travel Guide for Laane-Viru County, Estonia\n\nLaane-Viru County\n\n\nEstonia\n\n\nPopular cities in Laane-Viru County\n\n\nVenture to sights like Rakvere Citizen's Home Museum and Aqva Hotel & Spa Water Park and Sauna Complex as you discover Rakvere.\n\nVenture to Simuna Nature Studies and Hiking Trail and Rakvere Oak Grove Hiking Trail—just two of the sights around Aburi.\n\n\nStay near popular Laane-Viru County attractions\n\n\nAqva Hotel & Spa Water Park and Sauna Complex\n\nBring the family to Aqva Hotel & Spa Water Park and Sauna Complex and enjoy the excitement of this amusement park in Rakvere. While in the area, you can find time to visit its spas.\n\n\nExplore a world of travel with Expedia\n\n\nGo further with the Expedia app\n\nSave even more - get up to 20% on select hotels when you book on the app. Our app deals help you to save on trips so you can travel more and manage it all on the go.\n\nScan the QR code with your device camera and download our app\n\n\nacfd0447-9ea4-4987-b78d-80acc5422e7ed5359d60-9bd4-4dd5-b716-552ae95160df",
